      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Make the right move with your #1 Agency!\r\n\r\nWelcome to 64 College Rise, a spacious and versatile four-bedroom family home ideally positioned within a mature residential development in Drogheda. Extending over two floors, this well-proportioned home offers bright living accommodation, flexible bedroom space, and excellent potential for modern family living.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from a generous living room, a kitchen/dining area ideal for family meals and entertaining, a separate utility room, and a ground-floor wet room. A fourth bedroom on the ground floor provides flexibility for use as a guest bedroom, home office, playroom, or study.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms together with a family bathroom and additional storage space, making this an ideal home for growing families.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nGround Floor\r\nLiving Room 4.01m x 3.40m\r\nKitchen/Dining Room 5.27m x 2.85m\r\nUtility Area 2.12m x 2.66m\r\nWet Room 2.94m x 2.19m\r\nBedroom 4 4.57m x 2.19m\r\nEntrance Hall 4.40m x 0.95m\r\nPorch 1.88m x 1.60m\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nBedroom 1 3.88m x 3.25m\r\nBedroom 2 3.76m x 3.25m\r\nBedroom 3 2.77m x 2.51m\r\nBathroom 1.98m x 1.92m\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\nSpacious four-bedroom family home\r\nBER E\r\nGround-floor bedroom offering flexible accommodation\r\nGround-floor wet room\r\nSeparate utility room\r\nBright and spacious kitchen/dining area\r\nLiving room with feature fireplace\r\nExcellent storage throughout\r\nCobble lock driveway\r\nMature residential location\r\nConvenient to schools, shops, sporting facilities and public transport\r\nEasy access to Drogheda Town Centre and the M1 motorway\r\n\r\nLocation\r\nCollege Rise is a well-established residential development located on the north side of Drogheda. The property enjoys close proximity to a host of local amenities including primary and secondary schools, shops, supermarkets, sporting facilities, restaurants, cafés, and public transport services.\r\n\r\nDrogheda Town Centre is just a short distance away, providing a wide range of retail and leisure facilities, while the nearby M1 Motorway offers excellent commuter access to Dublin City, Dublin Airport and Belfast.\r\n\r\nBER Details\r\nBER Rating: E\r\n\r\nViewing\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the space, flexibility and potential this family home has to offer.\r\n\r\nFor further information or to arrange a viewing, please contact Declan."
      },
